# ============================================================
# MARITIME AI - FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# ============================================================
# Copy this file to frontend/.env and adjust the value for
# your machine. Never commit a real frontend/.env file.
#
# In development Vite proxies every /api request to the FastAPI
# backend on the same machine (http://127.0.0.1:8000 by
# default). Point VITE_API_URL at another backend address
# (e.g. a LAN IP or a remote server) to reach it instead,
# without changing any source code.
#
# In production the built static files are served behind a web
# server (see DEPLOYMENT.md) that forwards /api to the backend,
# so this variable is only for the Vite dev server.
# ============================================================

# VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000